  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,\r\n$$\r\nI=\\int_{\\pi / 4}^{\\pi / 3} \\frac{\\sin x}{x} d x\r\n$$\r\nsince, $\\frac{\\sin x}{x}$ is a decreasing function.\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{c}\r\n\\frac{\\pi}{12} \\times \\frac{\\sin \\pi / 3}{\\pi / 3} \\leq 1 \\leq \\frac{\\pi}{12} \\times \\frac{\\sin \\pi / 4}{\\pi / 4} \\\\\r\n\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{8} \\leq I \\leq \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{6}\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$",
